### Pré-requisito: rode http/users.http antes (cria o analista analyst@example.com, que cobre SP e DF).
### Este arquivo é autossuficiente: ele cria os próprios clientes e solicitações.

### 1. Registrar um CLIENT (se já existir, retorna 409; pode ignorar)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login como CLIENT (guarda o token em "client_token")
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("client_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 3. Criar rascunho em SP (guarda o id em "sp_solicitation_id")
POST {{host}}/solicitations
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("sp_solicitation_id", response.body.id);
%}

### 4. Etapa 1
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/steps/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "serviceType": "INSTALLATION",
  "title": "Instalar ar-condicionado",
  "description": "Instalação de um split na sala de estar do apartamento"
}

### 5. Etapa 2 (CEP de SP, dentro da cobertura do analista)
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/steps/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "cep": "01310-100",
  "number": "1578"
}

### 6. Etapa 3
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/steps/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "preferredDate": "2030-01-15",
  "estimatedValue": 250.00,
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 7. Submit -> SUBMITTED
POST {{host}}/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### 8. Criar outra solicitação, desta vez no RJ (guarda o id em "rj_solicitation_id")
POST {{host}}/solicitations
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("rj_solicitation_id", response.body.id);
%}

### 9. Etapas 1 a 3 e submit da solicitação do RJ
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{rj_solicitation_id}}/steps/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "serviceType": "MAINTENANCE",
  "title": "Revisar elevador",
  "description": "Revisão preventiva do elevador social do prédio"
}

###
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{rj_solicitation_id}}/steps/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "cep": "22785-275",
  "number": "25997"
}

###
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{rj_solicitation_id}}/steps/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "priority": "LOW",
  "estimatedValue": 80.00,
  "termsAccepted": true
}

###
POST {{host}}/solicitations/{{rj_solicitation_id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### 10. Login como ANALYST (guarda o token em "analyst_token")
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "analyst@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("analyst_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Solicitação do RJ, fora da cobertura (SP, DF) -> 404
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{rj_solicitation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Id inexistente -> 404 (mesma resposta de "fora da cobertura")
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Solicitação de SP, dentro da cobertura -> 200
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Iniciar análise -> 200, status IN_REVIEW
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Iniciar de novo -> 409
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Iniciar a do RJ (fora da cobertura) -> 404
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{rj_solicitation_id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Decidir com comentário curto -> 400
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

{
  "decision": "APPROVE",
  "comment": "ok"
}

### Aprovar -> 200, status APPROVED
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

{
  "decision": "APPROVE",
  "comment": "Documentação conferida e aprovada"
}

### Decidir de novo -> 409
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

{
  "decision": "REJECT",
  "comment": "Mudei de ideia sobre esta solicitação"
}

### Decidir a do RJ (fora da cobertura) -> 404
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{rj_solicitation_id}}/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

{
  "decision": "REJECT",
  "comment": "Fora da área de atendimento"
}

### CLIENT não acessa as rotas do analista -> 403
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### Sem token -> 401
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{sp_solicitation_id}}
